[00:05] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: '[music] We believe capturing life\'s most exhilarating moments should be an absolute joy. From the second you hit record to the minute you share it with the world, a 360 camera delivers on the first half of that promise, giving you'

[00:19] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'the ultimate freedom to document the entire world in a single take. But for too long, the magic of 360 video has been interrupted by the friction of the edit. At Insta3, we wanted [music] to fix that. Our goal is to offer an'

[00:32] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'intuitive, fresh experience that gives you your time back, making the editing process not just simple, but entirely invisible. Say hello to Zero Editing. To achieve this, we had to rethink how our'

[00:47] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'cameras understand your footage. It [music] starts with a smart, purpose-built foundation. We call it Insta3 Panomine. A fully in-house multimodal AI algorithm built'

[00:59] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'specifically for the unique demands of 360 video. Trained on over 10,000 hours of highly dynamic material. Insta 360 Panel Mind recognizes more than 30 distinct scenarios across a variety of'

[01:11] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'footage types, including travel, leisure, extreme sports, and of course, everyday life. The model intelligently recognizes highlights and recreates natural camera movements for you. To put'

[01:23] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'all that power directly to work for you, we built a whole new tool set designed around your workflow. Starting with AI Director, when you return from a trip with hours of sprawling footage, zero'

[01:35] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'editing shouldn\'t mean manually scrubbing through clips, picking styles, and waiting. It should mean that the work is done for you. With the Insta3 X6, your camera and your phone work completely in sync. Power your X6 and AI'

[01:48] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'Director gets to work once your charge is over 80%. Analyzing and editing your massive library in the background while you go about your day. Once it\'s done, a push notification hits your Insta3'

[02:01] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: '[music] app. Your footage is now organized into a new collection. Short, dynamic clips perfectly crafted to capture the journey. Ready to share to your socials or awaiting your final'

[02:13] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'tweaks. It\'s the definition of effortless. For those times when you want a bit more control, AutoEedit 2.0 adapts fluidly to your input. With just a few taps to select your favorite clips, your work is'

[02:26] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'done. AutoEdit 2.0 takes over, intelligently applying the framing, camera movements, cuts, transitions, and background music. And if you\'re looking to jump on the latest trends, FlashCut'

[02:39] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'offers thousands of templates that make recreating viral formats astonishingly fast and simple. At Inso3, we believe that the modern workflow also needs to live beyond the camera. We want your'

[02:51] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'footage to be accessible and safe anytime, [music] anywhere. Our Insta3 Plus cloud service acts as a bridge. It intelligently backs up your files, enables seamless cloud editing to save'

[03:03] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'your phone\'s computing power, and allows you to share interactive 360 videos with friends [music] and family using just a link. And accessibility is only the first step. To fundamentally change how you interact with everything you\'ve'

[03:16] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'captured, [music] we\'re introducing Moments Pro. Built with Google Gemini and Amazon Web Services layered on to our own in-house algorithms, Moments Pro gives you an entirely new way to build a video. It is'

[03:28] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'by far our biggest update to Insta3 Plus Cloud yet. Just choose the person you want to focus on, pick a mood, a style, or a time frame, [music] and the app takes that direction and builds a'

[03:40] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'structured dynamic cut tailored exactly to what you want. And we\'re pushing this even further. In future updates, Moments Pro will understand natural language prompts, meaning you can simply describe'

[03:52] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'the kind of edit you want and the AI will create it. It elevates the entire Insta3 Plus cloud service. Instead of endlessly digging through folders, your [music] massive cloud archive is now'

[04:04] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'transformed into an intelligent, fully searchable ecosystem. For years, the edit was the hardest part of [music] finishing videos. Today,'

[04:16] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'we\'re taking that hurdle away. The moments you capture become the film you keep. Beautifully edited, entirely on its own. This is zero editing and it begins with X6.'
